    "text": "Chapter 9 A Wedding Hymn",
    "contentType": "chapter_header",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 1
  },
  {
    "line": 1,
    "page": 153,
    "text": "Our Message",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  },
  {
    "line": 2,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "A Wedding Prayer and Hymn of Consecration",
    "contentType": "h2",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 2
  },
  {
    "line": 2,
    "page": 153,
    "text": "Resources",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  },
  {
    "line": 3,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Lord Jesus Christ, we bow in full surrender,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 3,
    "page": 153,
    "text": "Study Series",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  },
  {
    "line": 4,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "For Thou hast purchased us on Calvary;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 4,
    "page": 153,
    "text": "About us",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  },
  {
    "line": 5,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Now we are Thine, and Thine alone forever,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 5,
    "page": 153,
    "text": "CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  },
  {
    "line": 6,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "And Thou are portion for eternity.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 7,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Far more than all our asking and our thinking,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 8,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Have been Thy blessings on our lives, dear Lord;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 9,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "With praise and song our grateful hearts are ringing",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 10,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "For binding us with Love's eternal cord.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 11,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "We seek to serve Thee, conscious of our weakness,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 12,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Knowing full well that we are poor and frail;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 13,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Yet knowing too that Thy Almighty fullness",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 14,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Will be our strength and we shall never fail.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 15,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "We want the fellowship of Thy affliction;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 16,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "We want to glory only in Thy Cross;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 17,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Our one desire - to give Thee satisfaction;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 18,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "And we shall count all earthly gain as loss.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 19,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Reproach and scorn, this world may heap upon us;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 20,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Sorrows and trials may lie in our way;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 21,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Still we would walk with Thee alone, Lord Jesus,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 22,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Still we would love Thee more and more each day.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 23,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Give us the joy of helping others daily -",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 24,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Sharing their griefs, their burdens and their tears;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 25,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "O help us, Lord, to turn their eyes to Calv'ry",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 26,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "To find deliv'rance from their sins and fears.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 27,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Lord, fill us with Thy Spirit's mighty power;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 28,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Make us a blessing to each one we meet;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 29,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "O let Thy life flow through us like a river,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 30,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "And help us spread abroad Thy savour sweet.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 31,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "We only long to do Thy will forever,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 32,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Only and ever, Lord, to live for Thee;",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 33,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Then one glad day we'll reign with Thee in splendour,",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 34,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "And share Thy glory through eternity.",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 35,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "— Zac and Annie Poonen",
    "contentType": "p",
    "isHeading": false,
    "headingLevel": 0
  },
  {
    "line": 36,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Share",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  },
  {
    "line": 37,
    "page": 152,
    "text": "Who Am I",
    "contentType": "h3",
    "isHeading": true,
    "headingLevel": 3
  }
